@startuml
title Context 是有优先级的信息预算

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "总预算\nmodel limit - output reserve - tool reserve" as budget #E0F2FE
rectangle "P0 不可丢\nsystem policy / user goal / current state" as p0 #FEE2E2
rectangle "P1 完成任务所需\ntool schemas / core evidence / constraints" as p1 #FEF3C7
rectangle "P2 辅助\nconversation history / examples / secondary evidence" as p2
rectangle "压缩与选择\n结构化 state / claim-evidence / dedupe" as compact
rectangle "Context Manifest\nselected / dropped / summarized / source versions" as manifest #DCFCE7

budget --> p0
budget --> p1
budget --> p2
p0 --> compact
p1 --> compact
p2 --> compact
compact --> manifest

note right of compact
  压缩可以删除表达重复，
  不能删除权限、未完成状态和证据限定
end note
@enduml
